From acd20f6250fa3d1fe439176f925d340cf36656c5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Matterward Labs <admin@matterwardlabs.com>
Date: Tue, 1 Sep 2026 06:43:57 +0530
Subject: enable regular profiles on Android

Use Chromium profile lifecycle on the TaffyGo Android surface instead of duplicating profile directory allocation and deletion downstream.

Specified by chromium/patches/0042-enable-regular-profiles-on-android.md.

Taffy-Patch: 0042

